    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "Adjust Chara World combat speed.
<space>
<c t_cmd>[No]</c>
Chara World combat will play out
at normal speed. Hold <cmd CMD_GAME_CUT_SCENE_FAST_SPEED>
